<title>SWITZERLAND: SWEDISH ABB H1 EPS RISES 12 PCT.</title>
<headline>SWEDISH ABB H1 EPS RISES 12 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>			   (million Swedish crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Earnings per ABB AB</p>
<p> share, crowns	     2.26		   vs 2.01</p>
<p> Net profit		  2,121		  vs 1,884</p>
<p>Share in ABB Group</p>
<p> earnings		    3,479		  vs 3,132</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is ABB AB, previously named Asea AB. owns 50 percent of the ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG group. The other half is owned by Swiss ABB AG.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
